# =============================================================
#  VLA Policy Eval Layer — .gitignore
#  This repo lives inside an Obsidian vault on OneDrive. Several
#  entries below exist because of that, not because of Python.
# =============================================================

# --- Obsidian / OneDrive plumbing -----------------------------
# .obsidian/ contains a full node_modules tree. Committing it would
# add thousands of files and dwarf the actual project.
.obsidian/
.trash/
desktop.ini
*.sync-conflict-*

# --- PRIVATE: career context, never publish -------------------
# CLAUDE.md names the company being targeted and references personal
# weaknesses. See README note before removing any line here.
CLAUDE.md
00 Design/
04 Reviews/

# --- Python ---------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Model weights & caches -----------------------------------
# The OpenVLA checkpoint is ~15 GB. It is downloaded, never committed.
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
.cache/
hf_cache/
huggingface/

# --- LIBERO / robosuite assets & datasets ---------------------
libero/datasets/
*.hdf5
*.mcap

# --- Run outputs ----------------------------------------------
# Episode logs, rollout videos, sweep results. Regenerable by design;
# the harness is the artifact, not the bytes it produced.
results/
logs/
outputs/
wandb/
*.mp4
*.webm

# --- Secrets / infra ------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
.aws/
credentials
terraform.tfstate*

# --- OS -------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Keep these ------------------------------------------------
# Explicit un-ignores so the publishable artifacts survive the rules above.
!results/.gitkeep
!DECISIONS.md
!README.md
